fix.corrected_config:
Option A: If us-east-1 access is genuinely needed, update the SCP condition to allow both regions:
"StringNotEquals": { "aws:RequestedRegion": ["ap-south-1", "us-east-1"] }

Option B: If the SCP is intentional (company only operates in India), don't change it — instead launch the test resource in ap-south-1, or in a separate Sandbox OU that doesn't have this SCP attached.
